[38;5;252m[1m## What the library actually is[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Much smaller than the task template anticipates. [38;5;10mc_src[0m is one translation unit ([38;5;10msrc/lib.c[0m, 20 lines) plus a header that is almost entirely a [38;5;10mstatic const tflac_u16 tflac_crc16_tables[8][256][0m literal. The entire public API is one function:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mc
[0m[38;5;10mtflac_u16 crc16(const tflac_u8 *d, tflac_u32 len, tflac_u16 crc16);
[0m[0m[0m
